msgid ""
"Run a FLIR Lepton SDK command. ``cmd`` is the 16-bit command id defined by "
"the SDK."
msgstr ""
"Izvršava FLIR Lepton SDK naredbu. ``cmd`` je 16-bitni identifikator naredbe "
